function renderSelect(){root.innerHTML=`
  <section class="intro-layout">
    <div class="intro-copy"><div class="eyebrow">A STORY WRITTEN IN THE STARS</div><h1 class="intro-title">The Ember<br><em>Awakens.</em></h1><p class="intro-desc">A quiet village. A bell that should never ring. And one unlikely hero with a handful of dice and a choice to make.</p><div class="story-teaser"><strong>Every path leads somewhere different.</strong><span>Choose your class, roll for courage, and make the kind of story only you can tell. No two adventures need end alike.</span></div></div>
